      {
        "id": 171747,
        "name": "dpt",
        "username": "dpt",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-06T19:05:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For an August delivery, this is about when I would expect the surveys to go out--they need to finalize exactly how many units to produce. The use of BackerKit is new.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>On the other hand, I'm concerned about the costs--the cost for extra copies of the game does not match what was said in the initial campaign. So I'm not planning to respond now, until that gets clarified.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>UPDATE: I got a quick word back from Craig. There was something wrong, and they're working on fixing it now. So don't answer the survey just yet.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:54:30.869Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
